OL,3,GNEWSADeputy council leader steps down
OL,4,Aafter four months
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe deputy leader of a city council has
OL,7,Fannounced he is to step down after four
OL,8,Fmonths in the role.
OL,10,FIn a statement posted on Facebook,
OL,11,FReform UK Sunderland said councillor
OL,12,FDaniel Cowie made the "difficult
OL,13,Fdecision" after the "rapid
OL,14,Fdeterioration of his father's health".
OL,16,FThe party confirmed as Cowie was one of
OL,17,Fhis father's primary carers, he was "no
OL,18,Flonger able to dedicate the significant
OL,19,Fadditional time" required by the role
OL,20,Fwhile "balancing his family
OL,21,Fresponsibilities".
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
